<!-- ══ 1. IF / ELSE ══ -->
<section class="section" id="conditions">
  <div class="section-header"><div class="section-number">01</div><h2>Conditions — if / else if / else</h2></div>
  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="explainer">
      <strong>if</strong> exécute un bloc SI une condition est vraie. <strong>else if</strong> ajoute des alternatives, et <strong>else</strong> capture tout le reste.
      La condition est n'importe quelle expression qui donne <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code>.
      Les valeurs <em>falsy</em> (qui valent false) : <code>0</code>, <code>""</code>, <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code>, <code>NaN</code>, <code>false</code>.
    </div>

    <div class="code-block"><span class="kw">let</span> <span class="var-c">note</span> = <span class="num">75</span>;
<span class="kw">if</span> (<span class="var-c">note</span> >= <span class="num">90</span>)      { <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="str">"Très Bien 🏆"</span>); }
<span class="kw">else if</span> (<span class="var-c">note</span> >= <span class="num">75</span>) { <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="str">"Bien 👍"</span>); }
<span class="kw">else if</span> (<span class="var-c">note</span> >= <span class="num">60</span>) { <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="str">"Assez Bien"</span>); }
<span class="kw">else</span>                  { <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="str">"Insuffisant ❌"</span>); }</div>

    <hr class="sd">
    <strong style="color:var(--accent)">🧪 Cas 1 — Système de notation</strong>
    <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin:.5rem 0 .8rem">Déplacez le curseur pour changer la note. Le if/else s'exécute en temps réel !</p>
