<!-- ══ 4. WHILE ══ -->
<section class="section" id="while">
  <div class="section-header"><div class="section-number">04</div><h2>Boucles — while et do…while</h2></div>
  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="explainer">
      <strong>while</strong> répète un bloc TANT QUE la condition est vraie. Elle vérifie la condition AVANT chaque itération.
      <strong>do…while</strong> exécute d'abord le bloc, PUIS vérifie — garantit au moins 1 exécution.
      ⚠ Attention aux <em>boucles infinies</em> : assurez-vous que la condition finira par être fausse !
    </div>

    <div class="code-block"><span class="cm">// while — vérifie d'abord :</span>
<span class="kw">let</span> <span class="var-c">i</span> = <span class="num">0</span>;
<span class="kw">while</span> (<span class="var-c">i</span> < <span class="num">5</span>) {
  <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="var-c">i</span>);
  <span class="var-c">i</span>++;           <span class="cm">// ← OBLIGATOIRE sinon boucle infinie !</span>
}

<span class="cm">// do...while — exécute d'abord :</span>
<span class="kw">let</span> <span class="var-c">j</span> = <span class="num">1</span>;
<span class="kw">do</span> {
  <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="var-c">j</span> + <span class="str">" × 7 = "</span> + <span class="var-c">j</span>*<span class="num">7</span>);
  <span class="var-c">j</span>++;
} <span class="kw">while</span> (<span class="var-c">j</span> <= <span class="num">7</span>);</div>

    <hr class="sd">
    <strong style="color:var(--accent)">🧪 Cas 1 — Compteur while visuel</strong>
    <div class="input-row">
      <label>De :</label><input type="number" id="w-start" value="0" style="width:80px">
