<section class="section" id="trycatch">
  <div class="section-header"><div class="section-number">06</div><h2>try…catch…finally — Gestion des erreurs</h2></div>
  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="explainer">
      <strong>try</strong> contient le code "risqué". Si une erreur survient, <strong>catch(err)</strong> la capture et permet de la gérer proprement.
      <strong>finally</strong> s'exécute TOUJOURS, erreur ou pas — idéal pour le nettoyage (fermer une connexion, etc.).
      <strong>throw</strong> permet de lancer votre propre erreur personnalisée.
    </div>

    <div class="code-block"><span class="kw">try</span> {
  <span class="kw">if</span>(<span class="var-c">x</span> === <span class="str">""</span>) <span class="kw">throw new</span> <span class="fn-c">Error</span>(<span class="str">"Champ vide !"</span>);
  <span class="kw">if</span>(<span class="fn-c">isNaN</span>(<span class="var-c">x</span>)) <span class="kw">throw new</span> <span class="fn-c">Error</span>(<span class="str">"Pas un nombre !"</span>);
} <span class="kw">catch</span>(<span class="var-c">err</span>) {
  <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">error</span>(<span class="str">"Erreur : "</span> + <span class="var-c">err</span>.<span class="fn-c">message</span>);
} <span class="kw">finally</span> {
  <span class="fn-c">console</span>.<span class="fn-c">log</span>(<span class="str">"Exécuté dans tous les cas !"</span>);
}</div>

